---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Post.astro";

const title = "Data Deletion Instructions - WhatsApp Bot";
const description =
  "Instructions to request deletion of WhatsApp conversation data from Antonio Gioia's personal WhatsApp bot.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>{title}</h1>

  <p>Last updated: June 12, 2026</p>

  <p>
    You can request deletion of the data associated with your WhatsApp
    conversations with the personal bot managed by Antonio Gioia.
  </p>

  <p>
    To request deletion, send an email to
    <a href="mailto:info@antoniogioia.com">info@antoniogioia.com</a> and include the
    WhatsApp phone number you used to contact the bot.
  </p>

  <p>
    After the request is verified, the associated data will be deleted from the
    bot systems, unless technical or legal retention obligations apply.
  </p>

  <p>
    See the <a href="/whatsapp-bot/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for more information.
  </p>
</Layout>
